        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCCGR-ONE, Arched Front Door Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGrandeur's Arc One-Piece C Grip Entry Set is the epitome of classic style, with all of its traditional details coming together to form a beautiful front door handleset that is sure to show off your elegant tastes. The Arch Handleset with Traditional C Grip will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is available with your choice of interior trim knob or lever in an array of popular finish colors. The Arched Front Door Handleset is available in single cylinder and dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Arc One-Piece C Grip Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for doors that are 84 inches or taller.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Arched C Grip Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nInside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arch Handleset with Traditional C Grip",
                "description": "Grandeur's Arc One-Piece C Grip Entry Set is the epitome of classic style, with all of its traditional details coming together to form a beautiful front door handleset that is sure to show off your elegant tastes. The Arch Handleset with Traditional C Grip will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is available with your choice of interior trim knob or lever in an array of popular finish colors. The Arched Front Door Handleset is available in single cylinder and dummy functions.\r\n",
